e intermediate value theorem guarantees that $f(x)=k$ has a solution for each value of $k$ between $f(1)$ and $f(4).$\n\nSince $f(1)=2$ and $f(4)=66,$ we must have \n$k\\in [2,66].$\n\nAmong the given options, only $k=1$ does not belong to the interval $[2,66].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-105684/ma-source-field/eeb2438a6d8705502a3a42072684f614f995f6063924f7a9c63a3f28f1512701"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "6388d315-340b-56a0-bc93-e380bfbf6ed3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105684"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105880/ma-source-field/56c58bc83276919a551306138f0726e6b8e16306ebacf97b55211dedd89da71d/d35b8320f4f3e6e441a7f42972b657768698fe500d648c451bdebcc26c62e853" :answer/id #uuid "a0c01582-8a66-5f22-90c5-b43865692c9c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{1,2,3,4,5,6},{6,7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105880/ma-source-field/56c58bc83276919a551306138f0726e6b8e16306ebacf97b55211dedd89da71d/12263f6330f47d6cc3eb46f1e05733591666d600494e068759d5e2dc8c7117eb" :answer/id #uuid "31a5d50b-5c08-5751-a252-05a52b5023a0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{1,2,3,4,5},{6,7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105880/ma-source-field/56c58bc83276919a551306138f0726e6b8e16306ebacf97b55211dedd89da71d/ad8b6294e2b33ce024028c70c4126a29a3914b98991dcd4b7ee63e247df34bc2" :answer/id #uuid "9530eb59-6d94-5c62-aedd-6c48b431c773" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{1,2,3,4},{5},{6,7,8}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105880/ma-source-field/56c58bc83276919a551306138f0726e6b8e16306ebacf97b55211dedd89da71d/53c80a81a68c777eceb208be939ef6c94d5add9806cbae174f2c266c12f32a99" :answer/id #uuid "73b83c47-8c6e-50e8-86e1-5987cdfa845f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{2,3,4,5,6,7}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105880/ma-source-field/56c58bc83276919a551306138f0726e6b8e16306ebacf97b55211dedd89da71d/dc14f9