tion.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4},{1,3,5}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{0,1,2,3,4,5,6}}$ is not a partition because the element $6$ does not appear in $S.$\n\n- ${{0,1},{2},{4,5}}$ is not a partition because the element $3\\in S$ does not appear in any subset.\n\n- ${{0,1},{1,2,3,4,5}}$ is not a partition because the element $1$ appears in two subsets." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-105883/ma-source-field/adb8aa29712ebf1882bf1d2c204016f6512b2ac8f3f53a71648acb74166c3ffc"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1b082a95-4d6e-512f-a6ed-9100498d17c8"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105883"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105973/ma-source-field/0c6a4af91cd107fa9586147bd8f74145bc3a0c2c62bbd37da3346ddf0d634136/9b5112185f3e0477ee38c2b92c07c28723a802b36213ab15d8dd35083513ed26" :answer/id #uuid "60cc2336-5c97-555c-be41-06ae99e89f17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,4,8,…,140},{2,10,18,…,138}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105973/ma-source-field/0c6a4af91cd107fa9586147bd8f74145bc3a0c2c62bbd37da3346ddf0d634136/90a06ada95d79f4c95a85c8ddf72dc20c0b28b1e2f82f736e3222cac3545b2a9" :answer/id #uuid "b68b0d75-0dd4-54d2-bc16-28a83b214175" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,4,8,…,140},{2,4,6,…,138}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105973/ma-source-field/0c6a4af91cd107fa9586147bd8f74145bc3a0c2c62bbd37da3346ddf0d634136/0ec69fec99e2a5b4b42cdc5ab08d3ac3c5620249e2c9d5ee7c899d620bf9f6c9" :answer/id #uuid "3be72abe-4bfb-5a80-a21d-fb88f20ac945" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,4,8,…,140},{2,6,10,…,138}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105973/ma-source-field/0c6a4af91cd107fa9586147bd8f74145bc3a0c2c62bbd37da3346ddf0d634136/a067856d3d32941a5019f6bb4687486f05be273586b75126b64bb72cf36a1784" :answer/id #uuid "ed8a65fa-a574-5f0f-87c0-4becdef5b85c" :answer/