 is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0,4,8,…,140},{2,6,10,…,138}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${{0,4,8,…,140},{2,10,18,…,138}}$  is not a partition because some elements of $Y$ (such as $6)$ do not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${{0,4,8,…,140},{2,4,6,…,138}}$ is not a partition because the elements $4,8,…,140$ appear in both subsets.\n\n- ${{2,4,6,…,140}}$ is not a partition because the element $0\\in Y$ does not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${∅,{0,2,4,…,140}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-105973/ma-source-field/0c6a4af91cd107fa9586147bd8f74145bc3a0c2c62bbd37da3346ddf0d634136"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2b2a9a1d-2d20-58cf-a1ee-bee2f4cf120d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105973"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-105976/ma-source-field/4e4eb9f4219e231c0ac97004119a89b56f11de7ba27814654a1fe1deaf3b4edf/aa07721abaffc8d703d88b7aada707bf8cfc3c5ae6e103d7c407ac4d853d9cc8" :answer/id #uuid "848c6957-5caa-540d-8bff-a3623c7884b2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0,10,20,…,890},{20,40,60,…,900}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105976/ma-source-field/4e4eb9f4219e231c0ac97004119a89b56f11de7ba27814654a1fe1deaf3b4edf/35896e199ff0613720c7db4f7121df7a158661b6fef77e82dc8b0cd228be5e64" :answer/id #uuid "517768cd-d993-5dab-8ee7-13eb0fb7a83c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{0},{10,20,30,…,900}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105976/ma-source-field/4e4eb9f4219e231c0ac97004119a89b56f11de7ba27814654a1fe1deaf3b4edf/e9a6d9be1cc05ab17fceeb8f31108baed0f335867ae8735fc28150350cd14c17" :answer/id #uuid "d0faafc2-3404-5731-82db-935a87f5c58e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{{10,30,50…,890},{0,20,40,60,…,800}}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-105976/ma-source-field/4e4eb9f4219e231c0ac9