0,10,20,…,900},$ which collection of subsets of $A$ is a partition of $A?$" :question/worked-solution "A partition of a set $A$ is a collection of non-empty subsets of $A$ where every element of $A$ is contained in *exactly* one subset. \n\nOf the given collections, only ${{0},{10,20,30,…,900}}$ is a partition.\n\nThe rest of the collections are not partitions:\n\n- ${∅,{0,10,20,…,900}}$ is not a partition because the subset $∅$ is empty.\n\n- ${{10,30,50…,890},{20,40,60,…,900}}$ is not a partition because the element $0$ does not appear in any subsets.\n\n- ${{0,10,20,…,890}},{20,40,60,…,900}}$ is not a partition because it contains many elements, such as $20,40,60,…,900,$ that appear in multiple subsets.\n\n- ${{10,30,50…,890}},{0,20,40,60,…,800}}$ is not a partition because the elements $820,840…,900$ do not appear in any subsets." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-105976/ma-source-field/4e4eb9f4219e231c0ac97004119a89b56f11de7ba27814654a1fe1deaf3b4edf"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2b2a9a1d-2d20-58cf-a1ee-bee2f4cf120d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-105976"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/7603e3ded2eb180b05378773fafced67dbb02d079c17ea98edac3ba0f118efdf" :answer/id #uuid "82fba5c9-0131-541c-8948-a25c0d8eae2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[0,\\frac{\\pi }{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/96a865d4bb28ed6e96fc940867a37e6e9671c39a2eb0ac7f0dbfea5e98e4119e" :answer/id #uuid "0f87d6d3-3c3b-5273-849d-9b1476a53757" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[0,\\pi ]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/d5415bb83d35d76d1b88a5539a8100f03d693876172db33fec1567cff0512148" :answer/id #uuid "c5222c9f-23b7-5ec8-b93f-57e76ab64107" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\frac{\\pi }{2},2\\pi )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/60257a7214ff0337c366dfd312ad9bb8b671bdace6817615348b0092c556332c" :answer/id #uuid "232441c2-f7f1-5f16-bc4b-60b09c0b1593" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\frac{3\\pi }{2}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/770a95c293bd13db106ebde4bac5b83d71e2424854e76736f00d71578c0befe6" :answer/id #uuid "ef45acfd-4144-56f2-98cf-f241f28d614f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pi ]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8" :answer-field/id #uuid "dad99554-fa4d-57b5-9d6d-0148f288e880" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/7603e3ded2eb180b05378773fafced67dbb02d079c17ea98edac3ba0f118efdf" "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/96a865d4bb28ed6e96fc940867a37e6e9671c39a2eb0ac7f0dbfea5e98e4119e" "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/d5415bb83d35d76d1b88a5539a8100f03d693876172db33fec1567cff0512148" "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/60257a7214ff0337c366dfd312ad9bb8b671bdace6817615348b0092c556332c" "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/770a95c293bd13db106ebde4bac5b83d71e2424854e76736f00d71578c0befe6"] :answer-field/correct "q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8/770a95c293bd13db106ebde4bac5b83d71e2424854e76736f00d71578c0befe6" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-106293" :question/id #uuid "da600baa-a9d3-5724-9a5b-8920df8b8600" :question/math-academy-id "q-106293" :question/problem "![](images/d6/d698646baac96e15db7f447c0e1af6dbc0cb03cae50084fbfbb6cab15eabf565.png)\n\nThe quarter-circle above is defined by the parametric equations \n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta .\n$$\n\nWhat is the domain of the parameter $\\theta ?$" :question/worked-solution "The parametric equations of a circle  of radius $r$  centered at  the origin are\n\n$$\nx=r\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=r\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nIn our case, the radius $r=2.$ So, the parametric equations of the *full* circle are \n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [0,2\\pi ).\n$$\n\nTo restrict the parameterization to a quarter-circle, we associate the parameter $\\theta $ with the central angle formed by a point $(x,y)$ on the circle and the $x$-axis. \n\n![](images/b7/b76043921a3f9399049d6c3b4f557c7263da4d38a070c66a2dd444dbe2806c8e.png)\n\nWe can see that if we restrict $\\theta $ to $[\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pi ]$, we get the required quarter-circle.\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations of the quarter-circle are \n\n$$\nx=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta ,\\,y=2\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ,\\,\\theta \\in [\\frac{\\pi }{2},\\pi ].\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-106293/ma-source-field/e6f5cdd8524cc4f6d279ec8347c0025a7a7698328debc61940fae59e67805fb8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "1d81c7ff-8459-5559-bfae-c2a9c3bc739e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-106293"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/127edc0006185b6c575c49a2eb865b631d7eeae721ad839b10f2cd1e6a486b41" :answer/id #uuid "530d441f-02a7-58b9-ab67-967bf0eb2b26" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=28{y}^{2}-840" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/f0dc8f55811455c7ae189cb0c223a409bbc03654aa5f113d21aeb401e6990e47" :answer/id #uuid "84008fcd-ee7c-5c1d-b05c-17d7861ef713" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=840+28y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/70a167450540fa0ca5a26cc0b3be79290689c03b699ecdeb0e7f17ef458850db" :answer/id #uuid "0659f1ed-771e-5b24-b08f-cc16c97621ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=840-28y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/f7afaaf48b6168a153c395ef2b5e50b1f7f8dd019022fc32d4f130b13b08af55" :answer/id #uuid "65b83ad8-4ba9-5abe-ac5c-3f8478868400" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=840-28{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/2a4932299c8a1731b6870c8c4acffba9bd55fc4b3821f36fedf3846d7a8be1d2" :answer/id #uuid "129b2ea8-1b76-5424-95c9-8017f737962f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=840y-28{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b" :answer-field/id #uuid "0b25d0f3-fc25-51e5-b7b1-1eea7cc7a67a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/127edc0006185b6c575c49a2eb865b631d7eeae721ad839b10f2cd1e6a486b41" "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/f0dc8f55811455c7ae189cb0c223a409bbc03654aa5f113d21aeb401e6990e47" "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/70a167450540fa0ca5a26cc0b3be79290689c03b699ecdeb0e7f17ef458850db" "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/f7afaaf48b6168a153c395ef2b5e50b1f7f8dd019022fc32d4f130b13b08af55" "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/2a4932299c8a1731b6870c8c4acffba9bd55fc4b3821f36fedf3846d7a8be1d2"] :answer-field/correct "q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b/70a167450540fa0ca5a26cc0b3be79290689c03b699ecdeb0e7f17ef458850db" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-106654" :question/id #uuid "6f61f141-3dc0-53a6-8909-845a088a0525" :question/math-academy-id "q-106654" :question/problem "Given that $y>30$ and $t>0,$ which of the following is an inhibited decay equation?" :question/worked-solution "An inhibited decay equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=-k(y-a),\n$$\n\nwhere $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality, and $y>a$ for all $t>0.$\n\nFrom the given options, the only inhibited decay equation is\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=840-28y.\n$$\n\nTo see this, let's factor the right-hand side of the equation. This gives,\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=-28(y-30).\n$$\n\nIn this case, the constant of proportionality is $k=28,$ and $a=30.$ Note that for inhibited decay, we must have $y>30$ for all $t>0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-106654/ma-source-field/c7fdb1069508e21c25c5580733f1bd52aed8329576bce6afe894f4113f736e2b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "0709c667-bc10-5bd5-a383-3fd6ca332361"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-106654"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186124769 :question/answer-fields 17592186121181] {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/a2b02f00c12b0f90287c462249e4f894ac35e79f71f83e480db765153cc8f362" :answer/id #uuid "906da5cb-d9e8-5ec3-b4fd-cd8abe7cdb40" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=400-5y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/cc80a1b05e91896c2ad9cd705b0ddc7fb11c2068325432ca611097f9a94b196f" :answer/id #uuid "a5c36cb8-43dc-59ec-b220-e1d3bce29295" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=400-5{y}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/31250ec4b245b5b847f88c9e0c567c2522fb8437e3407b300d80dca38fb19001" :answer/id #uuid "fd4d9520-8eb8-590a-8484-786df4886f48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=5-400y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/7cbd8a71db74d7333ef66a411699b10473f8d13b27dcd121575411b8cd7cd486" :answer/id #uuid "4b2d8367-f11c-56cb-b66f-27a8c632bc41" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=5y-400" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/b221bffd417e34e5c706e302cd64c4a221bb43cc48ffecd73ef00271bc7daa7a" :answer/id #uuid "fa1db174-5614-5103-8d7e-cb38f5042fa5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{dy}{dt}=5{y}^{2}-400" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d" :answer-field/id #uuid "1b3476a6-1afc-5395-a095-cd169e19c687" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/a2b02f00c12b0f90287c462249e4f894ac35e79f71f83e480db765153cc8f362" "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/cc80a1b05e91896c2ad9cd705b0ddc7fb11c2068325432ca611097f9a94b196f" "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/31250ec4b245b5b847f88c9e0c567c2522fb8437e3407b300d80dca38fb19001" "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/7cbd8a71db74d7333ef66a411699b10473f8d13b27dcd121575411b8cd7cd486" "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/b221bffd417e34e5c706e302cd64c4a221bb43cc48ffecd73ef00271bc7daa7a"] :answer-field/correct "q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d/a2b02f00c12b0f90287c462249e4f894ac35e79f71f83e480db765153cc8f362" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id [:question/id #uuid "092a8c01-7fc1-532c-ba20-9cb4c823a717"] :question/problem "Given that $y<80$ and $t\\ge 0,$ which of the following is an inhibited growth equation?" :question/worked-solution "An inhibited growth equation has the form\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=k(a-y),\n$$\n\nwhere $k>0$ is a constant of proportionality, and $a>y$ for all $t\\ge 0.$\n\nFrom the given options, the only inhibited growth equation is\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=400-5y.\n$$\n\nTo see this, let's factor the right-hand side of the equation. This gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{dy}{dt}=5(80-y).\n$$\n\nIn this case, the constant of proportionality is $k=5,$ and $a=80.$ Note that for inhibited growth, we must have $y<80$ for all $t\\ge 0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-106662/ma-source-field/3ec596c83ee9cef94dd51b18451dc6080cd65db6305e1d53e0bda10113ed803d"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "0810fea6-41be-5418-8286-a95aa4107e38" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" :answer/id #uuid "d6b619c3-bb6f-5181-a851-c2867b29e2cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "31df6d64-a027-518d-a5a0-876806ffff3d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :answer/id #uuid "e92d7432-413e-559c-92e2-d37bcdd320e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666" :answer/id #uuid "d37ba473-dcd2-5cfc-b85a-96a412d2aad4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "18" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799" :answer-field/id #uuid "eeb5b488-d4bc-5127-bd59-0c5ddf346d66" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/choices ["q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/83c2285763389b0bc8b13e9777da06a48782d28e9c124603d3003cc4dc2e718a" "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/e326a281f601aec64d5dcce4921033c5f93cbf7f8b0a7a5809a9962dfadde666"] :answer-field/correct "q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799/650efaaa01beaa7de6c030497edff1dd29c570bf683f3726bbcacabc3dfa7e4c" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-106865" :question/id #uuid "ac90b5bc-97a8-5910-8e4c-691ef1d83be3" :question/math-academy-id "q-106865" :question/problem "What is the dimension of ${R}_{15}[t]$, the vector space of all polynomials in the variable $t$ of degree at most $15?$" :question/worked-solution "The standard basis of ${R}_{n}[t]$ is\n\n$$\n{1,\\,t,\\,{t}^{2},\\,…,\\,{t}^{n}}.\n$$\n\nSo, the standard basis of ${R}_{15}[t]$ is \n\n$$\n{1,\\,t,\\,{t}^{2},\\,…,\\,{t}^{15}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that \n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{15}[t])=15+1=16.\n$$\n\nIn general,\n\n$$\n\\text{dim}({R}_{n}[t])=n+1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-106865/ma-source-field/41195cde072063948d51b7551a05db8c6263b2f773f6fb8c5c4751b464b9a799"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2a8bf202-99c5-5bfd-8df3-5bd27cd65640"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-106865"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-106866/ma-source-field/2dc3a614f51128a8a4e116355bf5df9aaec79984e4db02c1a5c225e59c735684/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "9f7b17d7-82c2-5d58-9da3-45c942f05a12" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-106866/ma-source-field/2dc3a614f51128a8a4e116355bf5df9aaec79984e4db02c1a5c225e59c735684/0fbe558572ecce67593db00d22f0d8d9d09c98d019451cd13488790a441e6c9c" :answer/id #uuid "c3f89b7d-1586-5d0d-aa32-fad10cd50db7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/