1e7be"] :answer-field/correct "q-109951/ma-source-field/66c970614775310651adc78a5de02ddfecdd754428b3ee7192f57a3ab37d7500/943dcb751dcce0dce717fdf11e5dfa694d9470e178e42833c2a1150170553dc8" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-109951" :question/id #uuid "0aca92da-c648-5c8b-ae46-3b81f8b99c27" :question/math-academy-id "q-109951" :question/problem "$$\n{∬}_{D}\\boxed{}\\,\\text{d}A,\\,D={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 2,\\,0\\le v\\le 4}\n$$\n\nThe integral above gives the surface area of the parametric surface $r(u,v)=⟨{u}^{2},\\,{v}^{2},\\,uv⟩$ for $0\\le u\\le 2$ and $0\\le v\\le 4.$ What is the missing expression?" :question/worked-solution "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}({u}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}({v}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2u,\\,0,\\,v⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}({u}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}({v}^{2}),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(uv)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,2v,\\,u⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2u & 0 & v \\\\ 0 & 2v & u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}0 & v \\\\ 2v & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}2u & v \\\\ 0 & u\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}2u & 0 \\\\ 0 & 2v\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-2{u}^{2},\\,4uv⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨-2{v}^{2},\\,-2{u}^{2},\\,4uv⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-2{v}^{2})^{2}+(-2{u}^{2})^{2}+(4uv)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4{v}^{4}+4{u}^{4}+16{u}^{2}{v}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4({u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2})} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{{u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}2\\sqrt{{u}^{4}+{v}^{4}+4{u}^{2}{v}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-109951/ma-source-field/66c970614775310651adc78a5de02ddfecdd754428b3ee7192f57a3ab37d7500"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2928b0de-fadb-5ffa-b30f-72c0051f0ac6"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-109951"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-110214/ma-source-field/9ccb127ed7ea48dafdba822c5c339b8d5630506f6f0d8f4751bf5ed9a25d504d/183f637f813799a8910f98e88d27cc94e3e110c316c462096a0be2c03ff04167" :answer/id #uuid "96ff421f-9ec2-512a-9157-976daafdff3f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.04" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110214/ma-source-field/9ccb127ed7ea48dafdba822c5c339b8d5630506f6f0d8f4751bf5ed9a25d504d/c8530b2891d9503fb6de9f0eb973be3fd49bf431b04889083e8f7ddb6861ad0f" :answer/id #uuid "316119b4-ffd0-5c0e-b24d-dbeeefce6b87" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.16" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110214/ma-source-field/9ccb127ed7ea48dafdba822c5c339b8d5630506f6f0d8f4751bf5ed9a25d504d/2468d3f08d897d95f4d28b48c13e6034ce1716985d166fd89a0b8119476fe5c8" :answer/id #uuid "898e27b7-9ef5-5983-b123-9e3d1e0ea936" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110214/ma-source-field/9ccb127ed7ea48dafdba822c5c339b8d5630506f6f0d8f4751bf5ed9a25d504d/5d227958e8e2ab9feb7a492bded665cf59dfa9121f7d82334971c99adf799e26" :answer/id #uuid "6e6a8fa7-c348-5374-bcae-7fea018ed7b5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.25" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-110214/ma-source-field/9ccb127ed7ea48dafdba822c5c339b8d5630506f6f0d8f4751bf5ed9a25d504d/47e062f84c7679179a100f841000c1550fcbc886f881ad4b3253348673d23026" :answer/id #uuid "b3c