following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.1$ | $0.2$ | $0.4$ | $0.3$ |\n\nLet $Y=3{X}^{3}.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $a$ | $0$ | $b$ | $24$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $c$ | $0.2$ | $d$ | $0.3$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $b+d?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's add a $Y=3{X}^{3}$ row to our table:\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $-3$ | $0$ | $3$ | $24$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.1$ | $0.2$ | $0.4$ | $0.3$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distribution of $Y$ is as follows:\n\n| $y$ | $-3$ | $0$ | $3$ | $24$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.1$ | $0.2$ | $0.4$ | $0.3$ |\n\nTherefore, $b=3,$ $d=0.4,$ and $b+d=3.4.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-111309/ma-source-field/0982cae828061fffebd855b2fadcd0bee092212d9793c59bf9cc6585dbda4aab"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8995cd9c-994e-54e6-8213-f832e7dbf978"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-111309"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-111311/ma-source-field/cebf37f2a98deda14c8399346e19ef6ccd2d3dbfd0772b4d3182e3e335f12800/57f27b4de16f64fcab2f3b810a7087fb3b270a063a6807c410b738013ce41fde" :answer/id #uuid "b9caa425-46ca-5c2d-9317-f7c935d02abd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0.8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111311/ma-source-field/cebf37f2a98deda14c8399346e19ef6ccd2d3dbfd0772b4d3182e3e335f12800/09a797f0254edd22776128e046edd3557657fb445dcc367842699960b6d091f0" :answer/id #uuid "467c04af-80d7-599d-8f1c-7b916454d808" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2.6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111311/ma-source-field/cebf37f2a98deda14c8399346e19ef6ccd2d3dbfd0772b4d3182e3e335f12800/65cca031fb0c3d58e669bcbabbe43f8d54e4350ed6e256d1f00fa76238fc83d6" :answer/id #uuid "58cf5293-65e5-57ca-84cd-edef12644