-65f5-5733-b15c-2c116cdaa662" :question/math-academy-id "q-111311" :question/problem "The random variable $X$ has the following probability distribution.\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.25$ | $0.55$ | $0.2$ |\n\nLet $Y=5-{X}^{3}.$ The distribution of $Y$ is given below.\n\n| $y$ | $4$ | $5$ | $a$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $c$ | $b$ | $0.25$ |\n\nWhat is the value of $a+c?$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's add a $Y=5-{X}^{3}$ row to our table:\n\n| $x$ | $-1$ | $0$ | $1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $y$ | $6$ | $5$ | $4$ |\n| ${f}_{X}(x)$ | $0.25$ | $0.55$ | $0.2$ |\n\n$$\n\n$$\n\nTherefore, the distribution of $Y$ is as follows:\n\n| $y$ | $4$ | $5$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.2$ | $0.55$ | $0.25$ |\n\nTherefore, $a=6,$ $c=0.2,$ and $a+c=6.2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-111311/ma-source-field/cebf37f2a98deda14c8399346e19ef6ccd2d3dbfd0772b4d3182e3e335f12800"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "8995cd9c-994e-54e6-8213-f832e7dbf978"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-111311"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186176277 :question/answer-fields 17592186173890] {:db/id "q-111314/ma-source-field/4a415036ebeadf6e53a73969d74fb5923ae201797530ddb9f9cc3529121a272a/d886e8e4d162d08a2a8aabfd0f5a77173cc420ab6c664f98e098fcb1150e5d4f" :answer/id #uuid "7c6226fb-7e06-5bb5-bb84-bb5ec267fde9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16.1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111314/ma-source-field/4a415036ebeadf6e53a73969d74fb5923ae201797530ddb9f9cc3529121a272a/1e2848676a49bc06db83d4c2452df26fae868b843c9251da7ca1795e0e7ea8eb" :answer/id #uuid "2951c832-859b-5beb-b5d8-dc99394db577" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "16.6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-111314/ma-source-field/4a415036ebeadf6e53a73969d74fb5923ae201797530ddb9f9cc3529121a272a/2de615b058b