olution "First, we note that \n\n$$\nF(t)=\\int {F}^{′}(t)\\,\\text{d}t=\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t.\n$$\n\nTo integrate a vector-valued function, we integrate each component separately. So, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int ⟨4{t}^{3}+2,\\,\\frac{t}{4}⟩\\text{d}t & =⟨\\int (4{t}^{3}+2)\\,\\text{d}t,\\int \\frac{t}{4}\\,\\text{d}t⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t+{c}_{1},\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}+{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+⟨{c}_{1},\\,{c}_{2}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨{t}^{4}+2t,\\,\\frac{{t}^{2}}{8}⟩+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is an arbitrary (vector) constant of integration." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-123294/ma-source-field/b8b0d70eb2acd759c5514d0292e01ba6adca19be80ce0fbc610df4735e5b4386"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9688df89-056e-59d7-869e-9841715b2aea"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-123294"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-123320/ma-source-field/5fca22b4efb64eb34ef9781124c5a187655eb4ff55857d205d03881e7d4392d7/fe5fab0c2fa226f536686d49d322ce67e34e608b3a592d55ec3216660abac817" :answer/id #uuid "14ac1eba-4672-5629-8373-ade28bfada71" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡(2t),\\,{sin}^{2}⁡t⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123320/ma-source-field/5fca22b4efb64eb34ef9781124c5a187655eb4ff55857d205d03881e7d4392d7/a4a7b73f7c7743bcb9d7ecbbaeb19f75f470df81a03810a2de817c28f52b62b9" :answer/id #uuid "5c4a2e11-a04e-5177-8722-5ab93ed5a8c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,-\\operatorname{cos}⁡t⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-123320/ma-source-field/5fca22b4efb64eb34ef9781124c5a187655eb4ff55857d205d03881e7d4392d7/0134967ade583877fa8c4253ab3b9bcae8d7f6649e9b016fd7221495944fa101" :answer/id #uuid "a5a50cd8-428b-58d0-a480-7da1a3f92ab5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "⟨-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t,\\,{cos}^{2}⁡t⟩+C" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db