3⟩.$" :question/worked-solution "The direction vectors of the lines are ${v}_{1}=⟨-2,4,1⟩$ and ${v}_{2}=⟨2,5,-3⟩$, respectively. These vectors are parallel to the plane but not to each other.\n\nWe also know that the point $B(1,5,13)$ lies on the plane and its position vector is $b=⟨1,5,13⟩.$  \n\nSo, the corresponding parametric equation of the plane is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r & =b+s{v}_{1}+t{v}_{2} \\\\ r & =⟨1,5,13⟩+s⟨-2,4,1⟩+t⟨2,5,-3⟩,\\,s,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-128499/ma-source-field/1a95d056b5f94964012324f767ff172767bc8df4eb544ab694ecff5b87c0e35e"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3061cb06-f57f-57c8-8821-dbd962b1e78e"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-128499"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129480/ma-source-field/97e416c242c1ad261694a0d2ecc4cb409b33c27fd7a52280fe8b1c0e164791ff/2f6954e55cf8b92811dda36270c485a4690be47d716028c1483cb4704af8439e" :answer/id #uuid "639400d8-2573-593d-874f-f06ceff3176b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1\\times 5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129480/ma-source-field/97e416c242c1ad261694a0d2ecc4cb409b33c27fd7a52280fe8b1c0e164791ff/118e5a7f72b96743e316d609bd881f8c3defd6f8139c78ad3f21afe52f32b0a9" :answer/id #uuid "fb5de5b4-4d8b-5c4b-949e-2701f12f4f91" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\times 1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129480/ma-source-field/97e416c242c1ad261694a0d2ecc4cb409b33c27fd7a52280fe8b1c0e164791ff/65afab19d6cad34c98f038771e9e6ce46441ab27613f8dd2bbedf3c7facdae89" :answer/id #uuid "15c0f9d4-3d25-5fe4-b265-b619e9a4fe6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\times 5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129480/ma-source-field/97e416c242c1ad261694a0d2ecc4cb409b33c27fd7a52280fe8b1c0e164791ff/eae20e91d674a41fddda8ac96dc6953d27a746abf62d727ac1f51d7877bb0272" :answer/id #uuid "004a8839-e101