 is a particular solution. Determine the form of the particular solution ${x}_{p}(t).$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that the general solution of an inhomogeneous system can be written as \n\n$$\nx(t)={x}_{c}(t)+{x}_{p}(t)\n$$\n\nwhere ${x}_{c}(t)$ is the complementary solution (solution of the corresponding homogeneous system) and ${x}_{p}(t)$ is a particular solution.\n\nThe forcing term\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6t)[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nof the inhomogeneous system of ODEs is sinusoidal. Therefore, we assume that the particular solution is also sinusoidal, i.e.\n\n$$\n{x}_{p}(t)=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(6t)[\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2}\\end{aligned}]+\\operatorname{sin}⁡(6t)[\\begin{aligned}{b}_{1} \\\\ {b}_{2}\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwhere ${a}_{1},{a}_{2},{b}_{1},{b}_{2}$ are constants that are to be determined." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-332595/ma-source-field/359677fe5c7d7890e8bc70deffc4826a5d8b942abd4bcf9c5758f7b627011862"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3eecbfc4-f7eb-5d4c-bea6-8fd21839804c"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-332595"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-332739/ma-source-field/a3853248f42a3ca7865133e29857b44cb38cd8ccacd4f40762d854529f0fd2a3/68375a23d5139edc508301c833aefc3a327d2ac019c4aae2f0a1398a84041068" :answer/id #uuid "3910513d-9f11-530f-a539-554e1501e899" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2}\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332739/ma-source-field/a3853248f42a3ca7865133e29857b44cb38cd8ccacd4f40762d854529f0fd2a3/91eab7418a42941f3ec73dc37ce9bfdc08e72376a9fa102e1c2126e845261f9a" :answer/id #uuid "fcdc809a-8332-5157-8c0a-6ec6b0d41dad" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{e}^{2t}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3t)[\\begin{aligned}{a}_{1} \\\\ {a}_{2}\\end{aligned}])" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-332739/ma-source-field/a3853