x $U.$ Now, since ${E}_{1}A=U,$ we can invert ${E}_{1}$ to arrive at the desired LU factorization:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{E}_{1}A & =U \\\\ A & ={E}_{1}^{-1}U \\\\ A & ={[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}]}^{-1}U \\\\ A & ={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}{{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${l}_{21}=2,{u}_{22}=0,$ and ${l}_{21}+{u}_{22}=2.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-74799/ma-source-field/dc9022d84a6050c3dfa686855614f8c96f848a1b4e8f65d3554addb73dc651a8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-74983/ma-source-field/3ee7bd790d01b63620f936782985389520bca99fc570078c8be95c8ea6e4a95a/c9238cd78113b31b301d3d800f5e5678c2ff9d1eb76f45df86402dc035e63165" :answer/id #uuid "fc3249e7-fdcb-5706-802c-5570d6fe3271" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74983/ma-source-field/3ee7bd790d01b63620f936782985389520bca99fc570078c8be95c8ea6e4a95a/2e1b43939a264abbc875533e115347860bc3c87c72c493bf0f8ff06f5fdc35a2" :answer/id #uuid "295f5226-b06f-59ce-8bee-f5f0e7d2f7ea" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74983/ma-source-field/3ee7bd790d01b63620f936782985389520bca99fc570078c8be95c8ea6e4a95a/9faf7c6c9fa5302997ca975c3cc1a94a4bbca41a798eaad74859b0ed829e2146" :answer/id #uuid "86ed544c-9b1b-5948-a98c-2edfca55072c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-74983/ma-source-field/3ee7bd790d01b63620f936782985389520bca99fc570078c8be95c8ea6e4a95a/6a26ad641d0788a1cf670a17eb79cdf1409006a0b8aab6627fd82d005f8b3d5b" :answer/id #uuid "defe9182-b111-595e-8cbc-