a basis for $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/worked-solution "Any vector in $\\text{Null}(A)$ has the form\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}],\\,{x}_{3}\\in R.\n$$\n\nExpanding, we get\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-5{x}_{3} \\\\ 0 \\\\ {x}_{3}\\end{aligned}]={x}_{3}[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, a basis for $\\text{Null}(A)$ is\n\n$$\nB={[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}\n$$\n\nsince it is a linearly independent set and its vectors generate $\\text{Null}(A).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-74983/ma-source-field/3ee7bd790d01b63620f936782985389520bca99fc570078c8be95c8ea6e4a95a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3e66c269-233b-57f8-9dae-46eb78c228bc"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-74983"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-75002/ma-source-field/4e6e751fc9c0e1316b1dfd481881a2c88611ca72b1d769a4268e5dd7c743ecfb/dd7a5894a94afccf82e631ab71e15523d7b3e50f772f2802b414318e75c17921" :answer/id #uuid "8934b1dc-2328-512a-a797-e4693da7822e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75002/ma-source-field/4e6e751fc9c0e1316b1dfd481881a2c88611ca72b1d769a4268e5dd7c743ecfb/d190d9ca435f7a9a432abd68fe8900c4a685bae386ac7498fed8d3cccceac02a" :answer/id #uuid "7eadd515-94dc-5a17-a268-186f17d66000" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -9 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75002/ma-source-field/4e6e751fc9c0e1316b1dfd481881a2c88611ca72b1d769a4268e5dd7c743ecfb/6e415684a25b2d1342e16fe0ce2cb408bb61b36238c0cee2ae6f9fa15506a14f" :answer/id #uuid "9c55d222-5bdd-595b-ad83-8b10f159596b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "B={[\\begin{aligned}-9 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-75002/ma-source-field/4e6e751fc9c0e131