6e98" :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-94609" :question/id #uuid "8ed2d339-1669-5c85-b00e-540acdbbec95" :question/math-academy-id "q-94609" :question/problem "Find the center of the elliptic cone $4(x-1)^{2}+10(y-4)^{2}={z}^{2}.$" :question/worked-solution "The general equation of an elliptic cone with center at the point $({x}_{0},{y}_{0},{z}_{0})$ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{(x-{x}_{0})^{2}}{{a}^{2}}+\\frac{(y-{y}_{0})^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=\\frac{(z-{z}_{0})^{2}}{{c}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTo find the center, we rewrite our equation in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(x-1)^{2}+10(y-4)^{2} & =(z-0)^{2} \\\\ \\frac{(x-1)^{2}}{1/4}+\\frac{(y-4)^{2}}{1/10} & =(z-0)^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives us the equation of an elliptic cone that has its center at $(1,4,0).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-94609/ma-source-field/7c3d1af2662a8686d500207febe06092bfdcfbd03b2e52ed5a2f7ca79194d9ef"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "2e0b4012-403b-5739-8f33-3c79111129fd"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-94609"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-95216/ma-source-field/48a7173c34e06d46724806bd64a495489be35819ffdf359a0b0b785fb7ab131e/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "0b54db3c-8d6d-526f-a175-03ba6ce2af5e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95216/ma-source-field/48a7173c34e06d46724806bd64a495489be35819ffdf359a0b0b785fb7ab131e/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "3c610096-f546-51ed-933a-3503175a90be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-95216/ma-source-field/48a7173c34e06d46724806bd64a495489be35819ffdf359a0b0b785fb7ab131e/f345fac9a81ccd096b9959c6e7a966a446e93e73b82d111a376f9064132509fd" :answer/id #uuid "1fb12f7f-6eed-5940-a40a-4ec06ffa1f4a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer